<div class="panel">
  <h1>Welcome, Raider <%= player.name %>!</h1>
  <p>Your class: <strong style="color:var(--gold2)"><%= className %></strong></p>

  <label style="margin-top:4px">Raider Key — your private sign-in key. Keep it safe.</label>
  <pre><%= player.auth_token %></pre>

  <label>Install the private local companion</label>
  <pre class="install-command"><%= installCommand %></pre>
  <p class="fine">This command contains a one-time enrollment code that expires in 10 minutes. It is not your Raider Key.</p>

  <p class="flash" style="border-color:var(--gold-dim);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#26200f,#1b1712);color:#efe4c9">After installation, use <code>raiders on</code>, <code>raiders off</code>, <code>raiders status</code>, <code>raiders doctor</code>, or <code>raiders uninstall</code> to control and check your companion.</p>

  <a class="btn" href="/character?token=<%= encodeURIComponent(player.auth_token) %>">Open your Raider sheet →</a>
</div>
